---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="page-container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="col col-brand">
        <span class="meta">// DEVZEN SpA</span>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank"
          class="brand-link"
        >SEELE</a>
        <span class="version">v0.1.0-alpha</span>
      </div>

      <div class="col col-links">
        <span class="meta"><span lang="en">// LINKS</span><span lang="es">// ENLACES</span></span>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele" rel="noopener" target="_blank">github ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" rel="noopener" target="_blank">changelog ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/discussions" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span lang="en">discussions ↗</span><span lang="es">discusiones ↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/blob/main/LICENSE" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span lang="en">mit license ↗</span><span lang="es">licencia mit ↗</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="col col-respect">
        <span class="meta"><span lang="en">// INSPIRED BY</span><span lang="es">// INSPIRADO POR</span></span>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming/engram"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank"
          class="inspired-link"
        >Gentleman-Programming<br />/engram</a>
        <span class="version">MIT · clean-room</span>
      </div>

      <div class="col col-meta">
        <span class="meta"><span lang="en">// PRIVACY</span><span lang="es">// PRIVACIDAD</span></span>
        <p class="privacy">
          <span lang="en">no tracking<br />no analytics<br />no cookies<br />no SDKs</span><span lang="es">sin tracking<br />sin analytics<br />sin cookies<br />sin SDKs</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="copy">
        © {year} DevZen SpA · <span lang="en">all paths lead to localhost</span><span lang="es">todos los caminos llevan a localhost</span>
      </p>
      <p class="motto">
        <em lang="la">Super stellatum firmamentum iudicat Deus, sicut nos iudicamus.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    padding-block: var(--space-12) var(--space-8);
    border-top: var(--border-base) solid var(--semantic-border-base);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .brand-link {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-black);
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }

  .brand-link:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .version {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .col-links ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .col-links a {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .col-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .inspired-link {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .inspired-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .privacy {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: var(--border-hair) solid var(--semantic-border-muted);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .copy {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .motto {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .motto em {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
